		"kind": "archive",
		"command": "ld -o prog main.o libx.a",
		"request": "libx.a holds two members. The first defines `other`, which main.o calls. The second is the object shown here: the symbol index offers it as the definition of `never_referenced`, which nothing in the link mentions — but it also defines `_start`, and main.o defines `_start` too",
